    "text": "AdvertisementAdvertisementAdvertisementAdvertisementTRENDINGYankees shut out GiantsJudge's golden sombreroSign up for fantasy baseballOpening day starting pitchersSweet 16 previewStory byJason BurgosSun, Mar 15, 2026·1 min read1Add Yahoo Sports on GoogleThe 2026 edition of the World Baseball Classic is now in the elimination round. If you plan to watch MLB’s World Cup of baseball today, below you can get a look at Sunday’s game, upcoming matchups on the World Baseball Classic schedule, and other important details on this year’s WBC, including how to watch.WBC schedule todayDateGameTime (ET)TV InfoMarch 15Dominican Republic vs. United States (Semifinal)8:00 PMFS1What channel is the World Baseball Classic on?If you are planning on watching the World Baseball Classic games today in the United States, ematchup for the WBC can be found on FOX’s family of sports networks. Those channels are FOX, FS1, FS2, FOX Deportes (Spanish), TUBI, Fox Sports AppAdvertisementAdvertisementAdvertisementWho advanced to the WBC quarterfinals?After four games of Pool Play, the teams that have reached the quarterfinals, or elimination round of the World Baseball Classic, are the United States, Korea, Dominican Republic, Canada, Puerto Rico, Italy, Venezuela, and Japan.Upcoming WBC scheduleDateGameTime (ET)TV InfoMarch 16Puerto Rico/Italy vs. Venezuela/Japan (Semifinal)8:00 PMFS1When is the World Baseball Classic final?Sam Navarro-Imagn ImagesCredit: Jim Rassol-Imagn ImagesThe finals of the 2026 WBC will take place on Tuesday, March 17, at 8 PM ET on FOX.Related HeadlinesPredicting 2026 Starting Rotations: AL West EditionMLB Trade Candidates 2026: 8 Players Who Could Be Dealt This SeasonWorld Baseball Classic Schedule Today: WBC Semifinals Continue MondayDodgers are a Death Star: Can they be stopped?Dodger Stadium field undergoes name change for first timeOhtani tops list of most-popular MLB jerseys — againBrewers' OF Jackson Chourio (hand) placed on 10-day ILAdvertisementAaron J